{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17465","headline":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 八 · 权德舆","name":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露洗百花新，帘开月照人。\n绿窗销暗烛，兰迳埽清尘。\n双燕频惊梦，三桃竞报春。\n相思寂不语，珠泪洒红巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}